  "details": "Open a Portal to a VRChat world, and you will be asked to select the VRChat features - such as Pedestals, Stickers, Drone - to allow in the world.\n\nThis feature introduces extra friction whenever players want to simply hang out and do a world-hop. \n\nThe concept itself is good, but the selection for this feature should be part of a menu or tab and not an extra menu step before the Portal drops.",
